    "created_at": "2023-05-06T08:14:29Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-05-06T08:15:32Z",
    "body": "Yesterday, a friend of mine was using the _Tokyo Night_ as well, and had the same issue. I checked and it depends on the font used. I gave him a quick fix:\r\nReplace the following in the `format` section of `starship.toml`:\r\n```toml\r\nformat = \"\"\"\r\n[░▒▓](#a3aed2)\\\r\n...\r\n\"\"\"\r\n```\r\nwith\r\n```toml\r\nformat = \"\"\"\r\n[ ](bg:#445167)\\\r\n[ ](bg:#5e6c87)\\\r\n[ ](bg:#7d8bad)\\\r\n...\r\n\"\"\"\r\n```",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
